{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10211015","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10211015","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1021101501:1":{"text":"멜리사, 마침 잘 왔어.\n내 새로운 친구를 소개할게.","source_cn":"是梅丽莎，你来的正是时候。\\n给你介绍下我的新朋友——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86073247212D85D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1021101502:1":{"text":"친구는 무슨! 네가 잡아먹힌 줄 알고 얼마나 걱정했는지 알아?!","source_cn":"别再提什么朋友了，你知不知道刚才我在担心你被吃掉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5776B9F7114B4CD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1021101503:1":{"text":"잡아먹혀? 에이, 설마. 『고블린어 가이드』에 적힌 대로 대화를 나누고 있었는걸.","source_cn":"吃掉？哈，那怎么可能？我已经按照《咕布林用语指南》和他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48B5658E99BFAAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1021101504:1":{"text":"갈리, 그건 출간된 이후로 한 번도 개정되지 않은 교재잖아!","source_cn":"伽利，那本教材自从发行之后就没被修订过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E3B2B1EA5EE168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1021101505:1":{"text":"지금 교재에 적힌 걸 의심하는 거야?\n신께서 인도하지 않았다면 인간은 지혜를 가질 수 없었을 거야. 그러니까 고블린도 분명 지능을 가지고 있어!","source_cn":"怎么能对我们的教材有偏见呢？\\n没有神的指引，智慧绝不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD391361DC974FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1021101506:1":{"text":"내가 하는 걸 보면 너도 깜짝 놀랄걸?","source_cn":"我现在就演示给你看，你一定会大吃一惊的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48AE693CD9A7BD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1021101507:1":{"text":"꾸륵, 꾸르륵? 끼익? 끼끼~","source_cn":"咕咕叽叽？叽叽咕咕？叽叽~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B70DE8144809EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1021101508:1":{"text":"끼엑, 껙!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎嘎！咕咕嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x268B4D522CD1BA7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1021101509:1":{"text":"음, 그랬군. 여기는 나무 그늘이 져서 쉬기에 좋은 곳이라고 생각한대.","source_cn":"原来如此，原来如此，他觉得此地绿荫遮蔽，是个休憩的好地点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09000C8C2ECCB5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1021101510:1":{"text":"윽... 근데 몽둥이는 왜 휘두르는 건데? 정말 알아들은 거 맞아?","source_cn":"呃……那他为什么在挥舞棍子？你确定他听懂了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DEC2686AA682E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1021101511:1":{"text":"저건 감동했을 때 자연스럽게 나오는 제스처야! 우리 사이에 아주 기본적이고 효과적인 언어적 교류가 있었다는 뜻이지!","source_cn":"那是说到兴起而自然流露的身体动作，足以证明我和他建立了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BD5252F2D96C7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1021101512:1":{"text":"자, 이제 유적이 어디에 있는지 물어볼게.","source_cn":"接下来，让我问问遗迹的所在地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC06265835EA8928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1021101513:1":{"text":"끼끼! 꾸르륵, 끼익?","source_cn":"叽叽！咕咕嘎叽叽？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6162605325BB5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1021101514:1":{"text":"끼엑, 껙! 꾸우우우!","source_cn":"咕咕嘎嘎？嘎嘎呜呜呜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x451F7726785F6414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1021101515:1":{"text":"구구! 구구! 구우욱!!","source_cn":"咕咕！咕咕！咕咕——！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x249AE2BA216CAB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1021101516:1":{"text":"야, 화난 거 같아!","source_cn":"不好！你把他惹生气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C86C484D2ABCE03","variant_status":""